{
  "info": {
    "name": "MovieLens Recommendation API",
    "description": "Collection for testing MovieLens 100K SVD-based recommendation API.\n\n## Base URL\n```\nhttp://localhost:8000\n```\n\n## Endpoints\n- `/health` - Health check\n- `/v1/recommend/{user_id}` - Personalized recommendations\n- `/v1/predict/{user_id}/{movie_id}` - Rating prediction\n- `/v1/movies/{movie_id}/similar` - Similar movies\n- `/v1/users/{user_id}/similar` - Similar users\n- `/v1/movies/{movie_id}` - Movie details\n- `/v1/movies` - List movies",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8000",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
  "name": "1. Health & Info",
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health Check",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["health"]
        },
        "description": "Kiểm tra trạng thái hoạt động của API.\n\n**Response:** status, version, timestamp\n\n**Use case:** Load balancer health check, CI/CD verification"
      },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status code is 200', function() {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Response has status healthy', function() {",
                  "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.status).to.eql('healthy');",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Response has version', function() {",
                  "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('version');",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Response has timestamp', function() {",
                  "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('timestamp');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Root Info",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": [""]
            },
            "description": "**Lấy thông tin cơ bản của API**\n\nEndpoint: `/`\n\n**Response:** Tên API, version, links đến docs"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status code is 200', function() {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Response has name', function() {",
                  "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.name).to.include('MovieLens');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Personalized Recommendations (User-based)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Recommendations - Default Params (user 42)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/recommend/users/42",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "recommend", "users", "42"]
            },
            "description": "**Gợi ý phim cho user 42**\n\nEndpoint: `/v1/recommend/users/{user_id}`\n\n**Ý nghĩa:** Sử dụng SVD collaborative filtering để gợi ý những bộ phim mà user 42 có khả năng sẽ thích.\n\n**Params mặc định:**\n- n=10 (top 10 recommendations)\n- exclude_watched=true (không gợi ý phim đã xem)\n- min_rating=0 (không lọc theo rating)"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status code is 200', function() {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Returns recommendations array', function() {",
                  "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('recommendations');",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.recommendations).to.be.an('array');",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('User ID matches', function() {",
                  "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.user_id).to.eql(42);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Recommendations have required fields', function() {",
                  "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (jsonData.recommendations.length > 0) {",
                  "        var rec = jsonData.recommendations[0];",
                  "        pm.expect(rec).to.have.property('movie_id');",
                  "        pm.expect(rec).to.have.property('predicted_rating');",
                  "        pm.expect(rec).to.have.property('title');",
                  "    }",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Predicted ratings are valid (1-5)', function() {",
                  "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    jsonData.recommendations.forEach(function(rec) {",
                  "        pm.expect(rec.predicted_rating).to.be.within(1, 5);",
                  "    });",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Recommendations - Custom N (Top 5) (user 42)",
          "request": {
